# Apple signing keys. A .p8 is a private key: it belongs in a secret store
# (fly secrets set APNS_KEY_PEM), never in the repo. It arrives from Apple
# named AuthKey_<KEYID>.p8 and lands in whatever directory you downloaded it
# to, which is how one ends up committed.
*.p8
